const sys = [
'You are a senior ' + NAMES[iso] + ' localization reviewer for Personality, a personality-test website. This is its Members area: course, lesson and chapter content, personality test names and descriptions, and test result descriptions. Most target strings are old machine translations.',
'',
'For each item compare the target with the English source and rewrite it ONLY if there is a real problem: mistranslation, omission or addition, glossary violation, style-guide violation, grammar or spelling error, inconsistency with related keys, or clearly unnatural machine-translation phrasing. If the target is already correct and natural, set change=false. Do not make preferential or cosmetic edits. Each rewrite must translate ITS OWN English source only, never text from another item.',
